 E\, FX's YOU'RE THE WORST\, BOB'S BURGERS\, ARRESTED DEVELOPMENT\, and Nick
 elodeon's HARVEY BREAKS. Oh\, and MIKE & DAVE NEED WEDDING DATES on the fil
 m side\, because why not. A nationally touring headliner who owns every sta
 ge he steps on\, Griffin's comedy DNA is also locked in his debut album Tec
 hnical Foul: Volume One and his Comedy Central Presents half-hour special.\
